"guard.explain.title" = "Install Lumen's network guard?";
"guard.explain.message" = "macOS is about to ask twice — as it does for any network extension.\n\n1. “System Extension Blocked”: open System Settings and turn on “Lumen network guard” under Network Extensions. Only an administrator of this Mac can.\n2. “Lumen would like to filter network content”: click Allow.\n\nThe guard carries and reads nothing: it only keeps a profile with WebRTC through its proxy from connecting around that proxy. Other apps' connections, and Lumen's own, it lets through at once. This is asked once; Lumen's updates replace the guard without asking again.";
