"guard.notInBuild.development" = "This development build was made without NE=1: it has no network guard, and WebRTC is off in profiles with a proxy. The guard is in an NE=1 build with the team's provisioning profiles (docs/TUNNEL.md, docs/IDENTITY.md).";
"guard.todo.notInstalled" = "Until the guard is installed, WebRTC is off in profiles with a proxy. Click Install…: Lumen first explains what macOS will ask, and why.";
"guard.todo.awaitingApproval" = "System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions → Network Extensions (ⓘ) → turn on “Lumen network guard” → Done. Only an administrator of this Mac can. macOS then asks whether Lumen may filter network content — allow it.";
"guard.todo.off" = "The guard is installed, but its configuration is off or missing: without it the guard sees no connection of a profile. Click Turn On and allow Lumen to filter network content.";
"guard.todo.notAnswering" = "The guard is installed but does not answer — macOS may be updating it. Click Check Again in a minute; if that doesn't help, restart the Mac. Until then WebRTC is off in profiles with a proxy.";
"guard.todo.unproven" = "The guard has not been checked on this Mac yet: the check starts by itself and takes about 10 seconds. Until then WebRTC is off in profiles with a proxy.";
